Use these current file locations where they apply: backend/models.py, backend/main.py, backend/schemas.py, backend/alembic.ini and backend/alembic/; existing catalog components in frontend/src/. Create only files needed for today's task. Preserve existing paths unless a specific change is necessary. Return complete contents for each changed file, one labeled code block per path, and Mac run/test commands with working directories. Use VS Code GUI actions for Git operations. Do not use placeholders for facts already in the snapshot. If an account-specific value is missing, ask for that value before generating dependent configuration.

Our acceptance check is: Section A references Algebra and T1 with limit 24; invalid IDs and limits cannot be saved. Explain the expected observation and one relevant failure case. Do not report a pass until I provide actual output. Do not implement any later week's feature.

