If students use approved accounts on separate computers, their PR targets lesson/q4w7-mon until that class branch is merged. First, the teacher saves, reviews, stages, and clicks Commit, then Publish Branch (or … > Push). Students use Source Control > … > Fetch and the branch picker to open that published class branch; if already on it, use … > Pull. Students must receive today’s reviewed files before editing.
