4. Click Publish Branch for the first upload and choose origin if asked. If already published, click Source Control > … > Push. Confirm the branch is lesson/q4w7-mon and wait for the upload to finish.
5. Press Command+Shift+P and select GitHub Pull Requests: Create Pull Request. Set the base to the actual default branch and compare to lesson/q4w7-mon. Enter the lesson title and observed check results, then click Create.
